  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ngosuku lwesithathu kwaba khona umthimba eKana elaseGalili; wayekhona unina kaJesu lapho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "LoJesu labafundi bakhe babemenyiwe emthimbeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi ukuba liphele iwayini, unina kaJesu wathi kuye: Kabaselalo iwayini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wathi kuye: Mama, kuqondene ngaphi lawe lokhu na? Isikhathi sami kasikafiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Unina wathi kubafokazi: Alibokwenza loba yikuphi azakulitshela khona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona lapho imbiza zamatshe zimi khona ngokwesiko lokuhlambulula labaJuda, inye ilamagokoko amahlanu ingabe layisikhombisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu wathi kibo: Gcwalisani imbiza ngamanzi. Bazigcwalisake zathi kliki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi kibo: Khaninike, lise kumphathi wokudla; besake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umphathi wokudla esizwa amanzi asephendulwe iwayini, engazi ukuthi livela ngaphi, lanxa abafokazi ababewakhile amanzi babesazi, umphathi wokudla wabiza umyeni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi kuye: Wonke umuntu uletha iwayini elimnandi kuqala, kuthi lapho sebenathile kakhulu, alethe elibi; wena ugcinile iwayini elimnandi kwaze kwaba khathesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokho ukuqala kwezibonakaliso uJesu wakwenza eKana elaseGalili ebonakalisa ubukhosi bakhe, okwenza abafundi bakhe bakholwa kuye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho waya eKapenawume, elonina, labafowabo, labafundi bakhe, bahlala khona insukwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.4.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 4:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "IPhasika labaJuda lalisondele; uJesu wenyukela eJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20+EXO.12.21+EXO.12.22+EXO.12.23+EXO.12.24+EXO.12.25+EXO.12.26+EXO.12.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 12:1–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafumana ethempelini labo abathengisa inkomo lezimvu lenkwilimba, labahleziyo bentshintshisa imali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesenza umchilo wentambo, wabaxotsha bonke ethempelini, lezimvu lenkomo, wachitha imali yabantshintshisayo wagenqula amatafula abo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wathi kwabathengisa inkwilimba: Susani lezizinto, lingayenzi indlu kaBaba ibe yindlu yokuthengisela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafundi bakhe bakhumbula ukuba kulotshiwe ukuthi: Ukutshisekela indlu yakho kuyangidla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.69.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hubo 69:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho abaJuda bathi kuye: Usitshengisa isibonakaliso bani sokwenza lezizinto na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJesu waphendula wathi kibo: Dilizani lelithempeli, ngizakulivusa ngensuku ezintathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.61"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:61",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.27.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "27:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.58"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mark 14:58",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaJuda basebesithi: Lelithempeli lathatha iminyaka engamatshumi amane lesithupha ukwakhiwa, wenake uzakulivusa ngensuku ezintathu na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa wayekhuluma ngethempeli lomzimba wakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi esevukile kwabafileyo, abafundi bakhe bakhumbula ukuthi watsho njalo kibo; bakholwa umbhalo lelizwi ayelitshilo uJesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
